#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introdución"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalzium; provides you with all kinds of information about the Periodic "
"Table of the Elements. You can lookup lots of information about the elements "
"and also use visualizations to show them. It is free and licensed under the "
"&GNU; Public License."
msgstr ""
"&kalzium; fornece todo tipo de información acerca da Táboa Periódica dos "
"Elementos. Pode procurar moreas de datos acerca dos elementos e tamén usar "
"visualizacións para vé-los. É libre e distribúese sob a licenza &GNU; Public "
"License."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can visualize the Periodic Table of the Elements by groups, blocks, and "
"families. You can plot data for a range of elements for properties like the "
"boilingpoint or the atomic mass. You can go back in time and see what "
"elements were known at a given date. You can also calculate the molecular "
"mass of molecules."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalzium; quick start guide"
msgstr "Guía rápida de &kalzium;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is &kalzium; the first time you run it, either by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Edutainment</"
"guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Science</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>&kalzium;</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the &kmenu; or with <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo> and entering <command>kalzium</"
"command> into the field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kalzium; main window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>A xanela principal de &kalzium;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kalzium; main window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>A xanela principal de &kalzium;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalzium; is divided in a navigation panel on the left (in red, 1) and the "
"table view (in blue, 2) which shows the elements of the periodic table. The "
"standard menubar allows you to choose what you want to display and the "
"status bar reports facts. You can hide the navigation panel using the "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Sidebar</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you move the mouse cursor on an element of the table, an overview of "
"the current element in the <guilabel>Overview</guilabel> tab of the "
"navigation panel is displayed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can choose several views for the table: display the elements per "
#| "families, per groups, per crystal structure, depending on their acidic "
#| "behaviour, &etc;. You can change all that in the menubar in the "
#| "<menuchoice> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Look</guimenuitem> </"
#| "menuchoice> menu."
msgid ""
"You can choose several views for the table: display the elements per "
"families, per groups, per crystal structure, depending on their acidic "
"behaviour, &etc;. You can change all that in the menubar in the <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Scheme</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"Pode escoller entre varias vistas da táboa: mostrar os elementos por "
"familias, por grupos, por estrutura cristalina, en función do comportamento "
"ácido, &etc;. Pode modificar todo isto no menú <menuchoice><guimenu>Ver</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Mirar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to know facts about a precise element, click on it in the table "
"and the information dialog will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Se quer aprender cousas acerca dun elemento en concreto, prema nel na táboa "
"e mostrarase o diálogo de información."

